<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13174] C++: Add Windows support to CMake build system</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13174</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ticket&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13078&quot; title=&quot;&#1057;++: Add CMake build support&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-13078&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-13078&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; adds CMake build system support, but only for Linux. Need make sure it works on Windows and create TC job for it.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
