                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17152688" author="alex_pl" created="Tue, 7 Jul 2020 11:54:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt;,&#160;do we have a chance to resolve this ticket in 2.9 release?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17155340" author="ivandasch" created="Fri, 10 Jul 2020 11:11:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alex_pl&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alex_pl&quot;&gt;alex_pl&lt;/a&gt; I added patch, that supports cmake build on windows. Based on &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/7899/files&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;Igor Sapego&apos;s work&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br/&gt;
What tested:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Debug and release build on VS 2017&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Tests completes successfully, including ODBC&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Examples build and run successfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;I think that we can proceed with TC job.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17156557" author="isapego" created="Mon, 13 Jul 2020 08:42:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alex_pl&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alex_pl&quot;&gt;alex_pl&lt;/a&gt;&#160;yeah, I&apos;ll try to complete it today.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17171816" author="isapego" created="Wed, 5 Aug 2020 23:00:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;&#160;I&apos;ve fixed some problems with the patch and added PR from my branch to be able to check it on TC&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17181423" author="ivandasch" created="Thu, 20 Aug 2020 20:24:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt; Igor, is there any progress with TC build on win32 agents? Why this task got stuck? Is any help needed from me?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17183660" author="isapego" created="Tue, 25 Aug 2020 01:15:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;&#160;I was on vacation. No help is needed, the task is almost done, I&apos;m running latest tests.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17185480" author="isapego" created="Wed, 26 Aug 2020 21:08:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;&#160;I&apos;ve prepared suites: &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_PlatformCCMakeWinX64Debug/5565508?focusLine=0&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_PlatformCCMakeWinX64Debug&lt;/a&gt;&#160;and &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_WiPPlatformCCMakeWinX64Release&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/buildConfiguration/IgniteTests24Java8_WiPPlatformCCMakeWinX64Release&lt;/a&gt;, they seem to be building and running, but there are some problems now with some tests and examples. Working on finding out what can cause issues.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17200009" author="isapego" created="Tue, 22 Sep 2020 11:26:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;&#160;everything seems ready. Please, review suites and changes in PR (i&apos;ve created a new one, as I can not modify yours).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17200096" author="ivandasch" created="Tue, 22 Sep 2020 13:57:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt; Good news! I see, that there is some problems with ODBC tests in debug configuration, but in release everything is ok. I suppose, that debug configuration is a littlbe bit outdated in TC. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;PR with your changes looks good to me!&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
                            <comment id="17201811" author="isapego" created="Thu, 24 Sep 2020 23:17:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ivandasch&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ivandasch&quot;&gt;ivandasch&lt;/a&gt;&#160;it&apos;s just the same as current Windows Debug suite (which is seems to be broken and disabled). I&apos;m going to merge the PR to master and deal with Debug configuration in both suites.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17201813" author="isapego" created="Thu, 24 Sep 2020 23:22:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
